      "explanation": "The tree-and-roots emblem visible on every slide (cover medallion, tags, and eyebrow logo on slides 9-10) is visually consistent with the supplied approved emblem reference: same canopy/root silhouette in a rounded frame. No slide obscures food or wording with the mark.",
      "caption_quote": "",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "Compare the visible Añejo emblem with the separately supplied approved emblem reference, without obscuring food or required wording. This is visual consistency only, not proof of the original source asset, rendering provenance or photo authenticity. If the reference is absent or comparison is uncertain, mark unknown. Event packaging colors are allowed and need not match the corporate palette."
    },
    {
      "evidence_anchor": "slide:9",
      "criterion_id": "readability",
