        10
      ],
      "explanation": "All headline, row heading and body text on slides 9-10 is rendered in clear high-contrast gold/cream on dark forest green with no clipping or truncation. Slides 1-8 short headline overlays (e.g. 'Halloween', 'Christmas') are legible against their backgrounds and do not cover food.",
      "caption_quote": "",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "Required wording and food must remain visible within the finished frame. Flag concrete clipping, unreadability or obstruction, not personal layout preferences."
    },
    {
      "evidence_anchor": "caption:4",
