      ],
      "explanation": "Caption promises 'La Cajita' presentation choices and personalization; the carousel opens with the Signature Cajita cover (slide 1), moves through theme inspirations (slides 2-8), then personalization (slide 9) and planning steps (slide 10), matching the caption's described journey. No trays are promised, so none are required.",
      "caption_quote": "Message us “CAJITA” with your event date, city and guest count, or choose Catering & Events in our bio.",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "Judge the caption against the complete carousel. A cover promising both Cajitas and trays must show both. A menu collage may introduce multiple catering formats."
    },
    {
      "evidence_anchor": "slide:1",
      "criterion_id": "themed_packaging",
      "status": "met",
      "caption_line": 0,
      "slides": [
        1,
