        7,
        8,
        9,
        10
      ],
      "explanation": "Slides 2-8 show owner-approved event color themes (gender-reveal pastels, Halloween, Christmas, Valentine's, Easter, patriotic, elegant black/gold) layered onto the same Cajita box and emblem sticker, consistent with the brief's allowance that event colors demonstrate customization without replacing the corporate identity.",
      "caption_quote": "",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "Owner-approved event colors, theme illustrations and personalization are permitted on packaging and design. They do not replace the corporate identity or imply literal food ingredients."
    },
    {
