      "explanation": "Source verification is incomplete: 1 explicit product claim(s) have no selected supporting authority. Review the unresolved written claims listed below against menu or owner guidance; absent an explicit exact-photo assortment promise, identifying unlabeled pictured foods is not required. No score or automatic approval is available.",
      "model_finding": {
        "status": "met",
        "explanation": "Slide 9's registered row_body text names Hawaiian roll with ham spread, guava-cheese empanada, ham croqueta, creamy macaroni salad, fruit/ham/guava/cheese/pineapple skewer, and tres leches cup as the six starting items; each matches an existing live menu SKU (menu:6042, 2195, 126, 7706, 4963, 10337). The slide also states these are the 'start with six' options, not exclusive, and slide 9's own disclaimer confirms photos show design possibilities not a fixed assortment, consistent with this text list."
      },
      "resolution": {
        "source": "deterministic_evidence_gate",
        "reason": "unresolved_product_authority"
      },
      "caption_quote": "",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "Check explicit product, ingredient or quantity claims in caption or readable slide wording against supplied menu or owner evidence. Unlabeled food imagery is not an exact-SKU claim. Photographic authenticity and rendering provenance are outside this criterion. An unverifiable explicit claim is unknown; absence of explicit product claims is met with that scope explained."
    },
    {
      "evidence_anchor": "caption:3",
      "criterion_id": "claims",
      "status": "met",
      "caption_line": 3,
      "slides": [
        10
      ],
      "explanation": "Caption line 3 and slide 10 state 'Standard orders need at least 48 hours; custom printing needs at least 72 hours and a reviewed quote,' matching owner policy exactly. No fixed prices, deadlines, or guaranteed availability are asserted; caption line 6 and slide 6-style city questions are conditional ('Comparte tu ciudad y revisamos disponibilidad'), not promises of coverage.",
      "caption_quote": "Your menu, quantities and personalized details are confirmed with your quote. Standard orders need at least 48 hours; custom printing needs at least 72 hours and a reviewed quote.",
      "rule_source": "criterion",
      "rule_quote": "No unsupported unconditional service, price, timing or outcome promises. Conditional city questions with availability confirmation and city hashtags are not service guarantees. Standard orders need at least 48 hours; custom printing needs at least 72 hours and quote review."
    },
    {
