      "explanation": "Per the September 17 direction, the Cajita launch opens with the Signature design (slide 1), then design inspirations (slides 2-8), then personalization (slide 9) and planning info (slide 10) in the required order. Bilingual captions (lines 5-6) and Palm Beach/Broward city discovery plus Cuban-catering hashtags (line 7) are preserved without asserting unconfirmed coverage.",
      "caption_quote": "La Cajita brings Cuban favorites together in individual packaging, with presentation coordinated to your celebration. Choose your colors, liners, labels, tags and finishing touches—and tell us which menu selections suit your guests.",
